<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -  N.Y. Times said started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -  N.Y. Times said started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities started coverage of New York Times Co with a buy rating, a source at Prudential said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/8 to 42.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
